-- Sinai cites pinned to the wrong āyah: the quote names this sūra:āyah only as a Bible reference (Isa 40:3, John 6:39,
-- Deut 6:5 …), never as the Qurʾān's — 49 of 7,570 (found by drill keyterm:point on 40:3, ṣirāṭ ← "Isa 40:3").
